## indirectseam_none.rib's own scene, naming constantindirect then
## clearing it with a second Option: must render identically to
## indirectseam_none.rib, proof [""] clears the name rather than leaving
## the prior one in effect. Not third-party.
Display "indirectseam_cleared.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 48 48 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Option "render" "string indirect" ["constantindirect"]
Option "render" "string indirect" [""]
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.3931372549019608]
Surface "matte" "Ka" [1] "Kd" [1]
Color [1 1 1]
Opacity [1 1 1]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
